        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Leave days or vacation time to bridge the elimination period. Perfect attendance for 1999 and 2000 will be awarded, as prescribed under the Collective Barreaining Agreement, in January of 2001. In the future Leave days will no longer be awarded for perfect attendance, Supervisors will continue to grant authorized voluntary time as work schedules permit. Leave days (if awarded from the previous program) will not be paid out when an employee retires or terminates. Employees may use Leave days prior to retiring.",
